WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:02.869
Oh!

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:17.584
Gonna swing when it
comes off that corner.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.986
Put it down.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.054
Just let it go.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:21.855
Relax.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.056
It's not gonna go anywhere.

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:30.930
[laughs] That's a lot
better there than a minute

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:33.099
ago swinging off the ladder.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.001
Fortunately, no
accidents happened.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:36.536
A couple of times
some good close

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.905
reminders of pay
attention to what

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:41.207
you're doing, because bad
things happen really quick.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.279
First time's always the hardest.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:50.250
First time's always the
hardest, and once we started,

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.186
the second time
worked pretty good.

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.988
Let it down.

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:55.889
Good.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.056
Perfect.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:58.324
The third time worked great.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:01.394
So it's just a matter of
paying attention to each time

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:04.531
you do something, and then
modifying it a little bit.

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.832
Here we go.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.967
Floor's closing.

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:09.269
Wow!

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.905
It's all closed up.

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:12.705
Wow!

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:15.642
It looks like a stage.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:16.810
Come on up.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.781
Wow!

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.217
Look at it!

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.553
New York apartment size.

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:29.722
Oh, this is great, Andy!

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:30.657
Pretty solid.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.091
You should be happy with this.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:38.198
Sometimes you travel out
in bush or remote areas,

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:43.736
and it's a real uneasy
bad-vibe kind of a place,

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:48.341
but this hunting platform just
has really good vibes to it.

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.515
So that's the last one.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:56.316
Yay!

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:57.116
Yay!

00:01:57.183 --> 00:02:01.120
[laughs] Yay!

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:02.856
Let's sit right here.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.024
You can still see over
top of everything.

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:06.893
Yeah, let me try sitting.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.429
What's really cool too is
you can stretch out the sleep

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:13.233
and not worry
about rolling over.

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.668
To put the time and energy
into putting something that's

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.571
going to be really useful to
us, and comfortable for us to go

00:02:18.638 --> 00:02:21.608
back there and spend some
time, and really utilize

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.643
that piece of the country.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.846
That-- that's going to pay
off big for us in the future.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:28.648
[whimpers]

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:29.782
Chris is in the basement.

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:31.684
[laughs]

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.286
All right, well, I'm happy.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:34.254
You happy?

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.156
Oh, I am very happy.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.892
Tarzan make Jane new house!

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.426
[laughs]

